{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a  RPG in similar style to the classic SNES era of games, featuring a turn-based combat system alongside a prevalent &quot;Sneaking&quot; mechanic that allows the player to potentially avoid most of the enemy encounters found throughout the game.<br><br>Follow Sol and his sister Luna as their fate leads them away from a relatively cosy rhythm of school, cartoons and videogames unto a baffling chain of strange happenings that soon has them realize that life may not be that simple again any time soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566880?t=1771839760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566880?t=1771839760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566880/aed79816f36cd71cc367995bd310a939d93cf91e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771839760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566880/aed79816f36cd71cc367995bd310a939d93cf91e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771839760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a  RPG in similar style to the classic SNES era of games, featuring a turn-based combat system alongside a prevalent &quot;Sneaking&quot; mechanic that allows the player to potentially avoid most of the enemy encounters found throughout the game.<br><br>Follow Sol and his sister Luna as their fate leads them away from a relatively cosy rhythm of school, cartoons and videogames unto a baffling chain of strange happenings that soon has them realize that life may not be that simple again any time soon.</p>","developers":["Eleven The Lephant"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566880/afc1bb825ca